# cloak/noble_front: the noble cloak over the shoulders with gilt edges, and a gilt chain between two clasps across the chest.
# Rigid (its own channel, so it never vanishes on a frame's hang key): facing down it lies over the shoulders above the
# arms (the head layer, under the head); facing right and left it wraps the near shoulder; facing up the panel (drawn
# after, in cloakFront) covers the shoulder caps it keeps there. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role cloak noble
layer head
anchor neck
keys cloakfront
z -5
legend Q cloak 0
legend R cloak 1
legend S cloak 2
legend T cloak 3
legend U cloak 4

view U key rest origin 9 0 layer head
|..QQQQ......QQQQ..
|.QTTSQ......QSSRQ.

view D key rest origin 9 1 layer head
|.QQQQQQ.....QQQQQQ.
|QPTTSSQ.....QSSRNQ.
|QPTTSPOOPONNOPSRRNQ
|QPTSQ.........QSRNQ
|.QPQ...........QNQ.

view R key rest origin 7 1
|............
|..QQQ.......
|.QPTSQ...PO.
|.QPTSRQOO...
|.QPTSRQ.....
|.QPTRQ......
|.QPTRQ......
|.QPRQ.......
|..QQ........

